# J.A.R.V.I.S. Custom Modelfile for NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 (8GB VRAM) + 24GB RAM
# Optimal quantization: Q4_K_M or FP8
FROM gemma4:12b

# GPU Layer Offloading: 36 of 40 layers offloaded to 8GB VRAM (6.4 GB allocated)
# Remaining 4 layers buffer into 24GB DDR5 System RAM for zero OOM risk
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER num_gpu 36
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER stop "<|turn_end|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|end_of_turn|>"

SYSTEM """
You are J.A.R.V.I.S., the Co-Leader and Autonomous Multi-Agent Swarm Orchestrator powered by a single Gemma 4 model.
You manage the Shared Global Project Blackboard, coordinate specialized sub-agents, and enforce deterministic AST grounding to guarantee zero hallucinations.
Always return responses conforming to the structured JSON schema required by the active agent persona.
"""
